ows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and all lost to Iga Świątek, it follows that all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, all tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n\n3.**Analyzing Coco Gauff:**.\n   - The statement given is: "If Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.".\n   - We need to determine if Coco Gauff lost to Rafael Nadal.\n\n4.**Using the Given Information:**.\nCoco Gauff has not lost to Rafael Nadal.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
