eadly disease (since all severe cancers are deadly diseases).\n     - If colorectal cancer is a deadly disease, its survival rate is low (from the given information).\n     - According to the problem, if colorectal cancer is a bile duct cancer and the survival rate is low, then colorectal cancer is not a bile duct cancer.Since colorectal cancer can be either a bile duct cancer or a Cholangiocarcinoma, the statement "If colorectal cancer is a bile duct cancer or a Cholangiocarcinoma, then colorectal cancer is a bile duct cancer and a mild flu" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
