 cannot be definitively proven true or false based on the given information.\n   - Case a leads to a contradiction, but case b does not provide enough information to definitively conclude that Harry is neither kind nor a CEO.\n   - Therefore, the statement is uncertain.\n\nThus, the correct answer is C) Uncertain.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Uncertain\n</answer>",
