messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAll of Zaha Hadid's design styles are timeless. No mass product design is timeless. Either Zaha Hadid's design style or Kelly Wearstler's design style. All of Kelly Wearstler's design styles are evocative. All of Kelly Wearstler's design styles are dreamy. If a design by Max is timeless, then a design by Max is a mass product design and evocative.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? A design by Max is a mass product design.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain", '<think>\nTo determine if the statement "A design by Max is a mass product design" is true, false, or uncertain, let\'s analyze the given information step by step:\n\n1.**All of Zaha Hadid\'s design styles are timeless.**\n   - This means any design by Zaha Hadid is timeless.\n\n2.**No mass product design is timeless.**\n   - This implies that if a design is timeless, it cannot be a mass product design.\n\n3.**Either Zaha Hadid\'s design style or Kelly Wearstler\'s design style.**\n   - This means Zaha Hadid and Kelly Wearstler have different design styles.\n\n4.**All of Kelly Wearstler\'s design styles are evocative.**\n   - This means any design by Kelly Wearstler is evocative.\n\n5.**All of Kelly Wearstler\'s design styles are dreamy.**\n   - This means any design by Kelly Wearstler is dreamy.\n\n6.If a design by Max is not timeless, then a design by Max is not a mass product design and evocative.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
